  "THE_EXPLANATION": "It is NOT that the machine cannot see the trader's long. It sees one -- on the SAME route the trader used -- but SEVEN MINUTES AFTER the trader has already acted, and it has already spent its one-trade bullet EIGHT MINUTES BEFORE, on a short in the opposite direction. A fifteen-minute bracket straddles the trader's decision and the machine is on the wrong side of both edges of it.",
